{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19108480","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19108480","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910848001:1":{"text":"나... 힘이 느껴져. 따뜻한 해류가 손에 닿는 것 같아.","source_cn":"我……我能感觉到力量，能触摸到一股很温暖的洋流。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A4A4D6FEF05072D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910848002:1":{"text":"오세아나가... 놓아줬어. 우리의 존재를 인정한 거야.","source_cn":"奥汐娜……她放手了，她承认了我们的存在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4AD4623CD3130F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1910848002":{"text":"오세아나가... 놓아줬어. 우리의 존재를 인정한 거야.","source_cn":"奥汐娜……她放手了，她承认了我们的存在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4AD4623CD3130F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910848003:1":{"text":"이제 목소리는 들리지 않지만, 감정은 아직 느껴져... 많이 지쳤는지, 나와 이어진 의식의 가장 깊은 곳으로 가라앉고 있어.","source_cn":"已经听不到她的声音了，但是还能感受到她的情绪……她累了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEDBEE41F3B5D8F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910848004:1":{"text":"우리에게 선택할 권리를 남겨 줬어... 해류와 탄생의 힘을.","source_cn":"她把选择权留给了我们……洋流与繁育的力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x986614C33D5EB421","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910848005:1":{"text":"我想把大家带回来。","source_cn":"我想把大家带回来。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x50446BE3E86BD1B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910848006:1":{"text":"정말?! 할 수 있어?","source_cn":"真的？！做得到吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FDDA464D8712CF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910848007:1":{"text":"我可以剥离大家的意识，用这具身体里神力重塑他们的形体，然后把繁育的权柄返还给所有人。","source_cn":"我可以剥离大家的意识，用这具身体里神力重塑他们的形体，...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xE17F5F22BF978569","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910848008:1":{"text":"앞으로 바다 일족들은 양분 없이도 스스로 자손을 낳을 수 있게 될 거야. 신의 조각들이 온전한 생명이 되는 거지. 하나로 모였다 다시 흩어지는 순환도 여기서 끝나고, 해안 지역이 위협받는 일도 없어질 거야...","source_cn":"以后，海裔可以自己繁育后代，不再需要养料转化，神明的碎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F7EB52789833BD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910848009:1":{"text":"왜인지는 모르겠지만 할 수 있을 것 같아.","source_cn":"不知道为什么，我感觉自己可以做到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5809AF783F63A7AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1910848009":{"text":"왜인지는 모르겠지만 할 수 있을 것 같아.","source_cn":"不知道为什么，我感觉自己可以做到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5809AF783F63A7AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910848010:1":{"text":"아마도...?","source_cn":"或许吧……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE60411021A86E6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1910848010":{"text":"아마도...?","source_cn":"或许吧……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE60411021A86E6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910848011:1":{"text":"음... 모르겠어. 하지만 상관없어.","source_cn":"嗯……不知道，不过没关系啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC85B40F34AC8B80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910848012:1":{"text":"나는 해월 가문의 딸이자 할머니의 말랑이고, 너희의 친구야. 그거면 충분해. 나는 모두에게 도움이 되고 싶어.","source_cn":"我是海月家的女儿，阿嬷的小浪花，你们的朋友，这就够了。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31D10D1A73A6F008","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910848013:1":{"text":"이 힘을 모두에게 나눠 주고, 다 함께 사람들을 되찾을 수 있도록 나를 도와줘!","source_cn":"帮帮我，好吗？帮我把力量分出去，和我一起把大家带回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B8DEB424E8982FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1910848013":{"text":"이 힘을 모두에게 나눠 주고, 다 함께 사람들을 되찾을 수 있도록 나를 도와줘!","source_cn":"帮帮我，好吗？帮我把力量分出去，和我一起把大家带回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B8DEB424E8982FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910848014:1":{"text":"어떻게 하냐면... 아, 너희가 가장 잘하는 방법으로 하면 돼.","source_cn":"怎么做呢……啊，可以用你们最擅长的方法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E4152061B999752","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910848015:1":{"text":"像你们一开始准备对奥汐娜做的，狠狠揍这幅身体吧！","source_cn":"像你们一开始准备对奥汐娜做的，狠狠揍这幅身体吧！","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xBE52EAD0D88FF4B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910848016:1":{"text":"야, 너 미쳤어?! 진심이야?","source_cn":"喂，你疯啦，你认真的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05B6C133D03E832F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1910848016":{"text":"야, 너 미쳤어?! 진심이야?","source_cn":"喂，你疯啦，你认真的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05B6C133D03E83